---
import LegalPage from "@/components/pages/LegalPage.astro";
---

<LegalPage
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How LockDraft collects, uses, and protects information."
>
	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<p>
		LockDraft is a publishing website. We do not require an account to read the
		site. We may receive information that you send voluntarily, such as your
		name and email address when you contact us.
	</p>
	<p>
		Like most websites, the hosting platform may process technical information
		required to deliver pages, including an IP address, browser type, device
		information, requested URLs, and timestamps.
	</p>

	<h2>How we use information</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>To operate, secure, and improve the website.</li>
		<li>To respond to messages and requests.</li>
		<li>To understand aggregate traffic and content performance where analytics are enabled.</li>
		<li>To display and measure advertising where advertising is enabled.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
	<p>
		The site may use essential browser storage for preferences such as theme,
		layout, and interface settings. Optional analytics, advertising, and similar
		technologies will only be used where enabled and will be disclosed through
		the applicable consent controls.
	</p>

	<h2>Third-party services</h2>
	<p>
		The site may link to or use third-party services, including hosting,
		analytics, comments, search, media, and advertising providers. Those
		providers process information under their own privacy policies. We do not
		sell personal information.
	</p>

	<h2>Retention and security</h2>
	<p>
		We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the
		purpose for which it was collected, legal obligations, and site security.
		No online service can guarantee absolute security, but we use reasonable
		technical and organisational measures to protect information.
	</p>

	<h2>Your choices</h2>
	<p>
		You may disable non-essential cookies in your browser, decline optional
		consent where a consent control is presented, and contact us to request
		access, correction, or deletion of information that you have sent directly
		to us, subject to applicable law.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		For privacy questions, email
		<a href="mailto:hello@lockdraft.com">hello@lockdraft.com</a>.
	</p>
</LegalPage>
